@startuml
[*] --> CreateUser
CreateUser --> SignIn : success
SignIn --> ReadBlogs : valid credentials
ReadBlogs --> UpdateInfectionStats
UpdateInfectionStats --> ShareInfo
ShareInfo --> ViewMedicineList
ViewMedicineList --> AssignWorkers
AssignWorkers --> [*] : completion

CreateUser --> CreateAgain : invalid details
SignIn --> CreateUser : invalid credentials
ReadBlogs --> ReadAgain : no blogs available
UpdateInfectionStats --> UpdateAgain : failed update
ShareInfo --> ShareAgain : failed sharing
ViewMedicineList --> ViewAgain : no shops found
AssignWorkers --> AssignAgain : failed assignment

CreateUser --> [*] : cancel
SignIn --> [*] : exit without login
ReadBlogs --> [*] : quit reading
UpdateInfectionStats --> [*] : skip update
ShareInfo --> [*] : stop sharing
ViewMedicineList --> [*] : close view
AssignWorkers --> [*] : abandon assignment

CreateAgain --> CreateUser
UpdateAgain --> UpdateInfectionStats
ShareAgain --> ShareInfo
ViewAgain --> ReadBlogs
AssignAgain --> AssignWorkers
@enduml
